{"battle":{"id":15101,"monsterGroupIds":"151001","sceneIds":"18001","focusMonsterId":"","previewSkinId":0,"roleNum":4,"aid":"","noClothSkill":0,"playerMax":1,"monsterMax":1,"maxRound":20,"winCondition":"1","advancedCondition":"23","hiddenRule":"3#1001","additionRule":"","myStance":"100","clothSkill":"","useTemp":0,"dialogParam":"","bgmevent":0,"fightTitle":"","fightDec":"","battleEffectiveness":0,"heroEffectiveness":72.5,"equipEffectiveness":40,"talentEffectiveness":7.2,"restrictRoles":"","restrictReason":"","trialHeros":"","trialLimit":0,"trialEquips":"","trialMainAct104EuqipId":0,"balance":"","actionRule":0,"noAutoFight":0,"onlyTrial":0,"aiLink":0,"bossHpType":"","actShow":0},"battle_dialog":[{"code":15101,"id":1510101,"param":"4#1","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300101","audioId":610009775,"text":"我想引用最开始42的论点。","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510102,"param":"4#1","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300101","audioId":610009776,"text":"没有数字之人无法踏入真理的殿堂。","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510103,"param":"4#1","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300101","audioId":610009777,"text":"既然如此，那十四行诗就不可能在真理的殿堂犯下罪行。因为她无法踏入！","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510104,"param":"4#1","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"510711","audioId":610010542,"text":"什么……？！","tipsDir":1,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510105,"param":"4#1","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"306610","audioId":610010111,"text":"好角度，维尔汀！这是驳倒他们的机会！","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510201,"param":"20#1","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300111","audioId":610009778,"text":"唔，不行，这太牵强了……","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510202,"param":"20#1","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"306610","audioId":610010112,"text":"别紧张，维尔汀，你已经掌握诀窍了！","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510301,"param":"1#151002","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"510712","audioId":610010543,"text":"这些都是拙劣不堪的诡辩，我们都看见她违反了戒律！","tipsDir":1,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510302,"param":"1#151002","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"306614","audioId":610010113,"text":"反对！“你看到了”不具备任何超越性！","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510303,"param":"1#151002","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"306614","audioId":610010114,"text":"现象世界的碎屑无法作为辩论依据！","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510304,"param":"1#151002","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"307901","audioId":610010302,"text":"反对有效，请诸位回到逻辑上来。","tipsDir":1,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510305,"param":"1#151002","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300101","audioId":610009779,"text":"既然十四行诗没有数字，而没有数字之人在真理面前形同无物。","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510306,"param":"1#151002","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300101","audioId":610009780,"text":"那十四行诗就等于没有冒犯真理。","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510307,"param":"1#151002","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300101","audioId":610009781,"text":"——她没有破戒。","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510308,"param":"1#151002","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"510711","audioId":610010544,"text":"唔！","tipsDir":1,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510401,"param":"20#2","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300111","audioId":610009782,"text":"不行，这是死路一条……","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510402,"param":"20#2","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"306613","audioId":610010115,"text":"再好好想想，维尔汀，回到数字上来！","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510501,"param":"1#151003","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"510712","audioId":610010545,"text":"反对！破戒人并非没有数字。我们都能看出，她大致属于整数。","tipsDir":1,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510502,"param":"1#151003","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"510712","audioId":610010546,"text":"因此她的标识是未知数，而不是无，你们的诡辩不能成立！","tipsDir":1,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510503,"param":"1#151003","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"307901","audioId":610010303,"text":"42的证明有效。辩护人，你还有要补充的吗？","tipsDir":1,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510504,"param":"1#151003","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300111","audioId":610009783,"text":"……","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510505,"param":"1#151003","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"306601","audioId":610010116,"text":"悄悄告诉你，维尔汀。","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510506,"param":"1#151003","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"306601","audioId":610010117,"text":"我们称呼犯罪者为“负数”哦。","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510507,"param":"1#151003","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300110","audioId":610009784,"text":"……我想到了！","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510601,"param":"21","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300111","audioId":610009785,"text":"可恶，如果能再来一次的话……","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510701,"param":"16#151003","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300101","audioId":610009786,"text":"这是一个很简单的证明。","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510702,"param":"16#151003","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300101","audioId":610009787,"text":"根据排中律，十四行诗要么犯罪，要么没有犯罪，二者不能同时为假。","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510703,"param":"16#151003","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300101","audioId":610009788,"text":"既然犯罪者记为负数，不犯罪者记为正数，十四行诗此刻是一个记为未知的数。","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510704,"param":"16#151003","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300101","audioId":610009789,"text":"那么，她既不属于“犯罪者”的集合，也不属于“非犯罪者”的集合。","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510705,"param":"16#151003","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300101","audioId":610009790,"text":"她没有犯罪，也没有不犯罪。这是一个悖论！","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0},{"code":15101,"id":1510706,"param":"16#151003","canRepeat":true,"insideRepeat":false,"random":"","icon":"300101","audioId":610009791,"text":"我请求重新商议对十四行诗的处置！","tipsDir":2,"delay":0.3,"type":0}],"scene":[{"id":18001,"name":"传道者之厅·内部","nameen":"The Orator's Hall - Inside","levels":[18001]}],"monster_group":[{"id":151001,"monster":"151001#151002#151003","spMonster":"","spSupporter":"","sp2Monster":"","sp2Supporter":"","stanceId":1,"bossId":"","aiId":3,"bgm":0,"appearMonsterId":0,"appearTimeline":"","appearCameraPos":""}],"monster":{"151001":{"id":151001,"template":151001,"skillTemplate":1141004,"skinId":630201,"label":0,"career":0,"career_weak":"","heartVariantId":0,"level":95,"level_true":0,"initial_uniqueSkill_point":0,"uniqueSkillLevel":1,"passiveSkillCount":1,"passiveSkillsEx":"","uiFilterSkill":"","hpSign":"","energySign":"","effect":"","effectHangPoint":"","highPriorityName":"","highPriorityNameEng":"","highPriorityDes":"","templateEasy":1051001,"levelEasy":55,"toughness":"","toughnessSkill":0},"151002":{"id":151002,"template":151002,"skillTemplate":1141005,"skinId":630202,"label":0,"career":0,"career_weak":"","heartVariantId":0,"level":95,"level_true":0,"initial_uniqueSkill_point":0,"uniqueSkillLevel":1,"passiveSkillCount":1,"passiveSkillsEx":"","uiFilterSkill":"","hpSign":"","energySign":"","effect":"","effectHangPoint":"","highPriorityName":"","highPriorityNameEng":"","highPriorityDes":"","templateEasy":1051002,"levelEasy":55,"toughness":"","toughnessSkill":0},"151003":{"id":151003,"template":151003,"skillTe